"Minimalism isn't a trend or a strict set of rules. It's a mindset that helps "
"you focus on what counts and let go of what doesn't. Whether you're just "
"starting to declutter or already living with less, the benefits go far "
"beyond a clean space."
msgstr ""

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
